<title>LEBANON: Lebanon's Jan-Mar budget deficit 1,065 bln pounds.</title>
<headline>Lebanon's Jan-Mar budget deficit 1,065 bln pounds.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lebanon's budget deficit totalled 1,065 billion Lebanese pounds at end-March 1997, according to finance ministry statistics issued on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The March deficit rose to 499.4 billion pounds from 311.31 billion pounds in February. The deficit was 253.9 billion at end-January.</p>
<p>The 1997 budget envisages income of 4,100 billion pounds against spending of 6,433 billion.</p>
<p>The ministry issued the following statistics (in billions of Lebanese pounds):</p>
<p>				Jan	   Feb	   Mar	 Total</p>
<p>   Expenditures	    503.6     576.7	 703.7	1,784</p>
<p>   Of which interest exp 243	 180	   245	    668</p>
<p>   Revenues		  250	 265	   204.3	  719</p>
<p>   Deficit		   253.6     311.7	 499.4	 1,065</p>
</text>
